# A long map credit: the engine cuts it with "..." in one row above the scale bar; the app covers that row with the
# whole credit (abbreviated, in up to two lines) on a plate over the engine's box, clear of the scale bar and the
# zoom buttons (core/attribution.hpp). A short credit (the other scenes) is left to the engine.
title Long map credit: whole text, two lines, clear of the scale bar
sizes 640x480 480x320 320x480 480x800
env DECKATLAS_DEMO 1
env DECKATLAS_VIEW 48.886392,2.27417,15
env DECKATLAS_ATTRIBUTION "Map data: &copy; OpenStreetMap contributors, SRTM | Map style: &copy; OpenTopoMap (CC-BY-SA)"

wait 1500
shot long-credit
expect noquit
expect text "Map"

# a pan and a zoom keep the plate where it is
type +
wait 900
key right
wait 900
shot long-credit-zoomed
